# fixtures/rust-serialized-*.json are rewritten by `cargo test` (which always
# writes LF) and read back by the frontend test suite. The repo has
# core.autocrlf=true, so without this a fresh checkout would hand those files
# CRLF working copies until the next cargo run. Pin them to LF so the generated
# bytes are the same everywhere and a dirty `git status` after a test run means
# the wire format genuinely changed.
fixtures/*.json text eol=lf

# Binary assets belong in Git LFS. Git attributes cannot detect binary content
# dynamically, so keep the extension list broad enough to cover media, fonts,
# model weights, archives, native binaries, and binary design documents.

